---
import { Picture } from "astro:assets";
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
import { url } from "../lib/site";
import { cliSession, toHtml } from "../lib/cli-demo";
import tuiShot from "../../../docs/screenshots/tui-list-dark.png";
import graphShot from "../../../docs/screenshots/desktop-graph-dark.png";
import paletteShot from "../../../docs/screenshots/desktop-command-palette-light.png";

const tabs = [
  { key: "cli", label: "CLI", icon: "Terminal" },
  { key: "tui", label: "TUI", icon: "SquareTerminal" },
  { key: "desktop", label: "Desktop", icon: "Monitor" },
  { key: "mcp", label: "MCP", icon: "Bot" },
];
const mcpJson = `{
  "mcpServers": {
    "portwise": { "command": "portwise", "args": ["mcp"] }
  }
}`;
const sizes = "(max-width: 900px) calc(100vw - 40px), 640px";
---
<section id="interfaces" class="section interfaces" aria-labelledby="if-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head center">
      <span class="eyebrow">Interfaces</span>
      <h2 class="h2" id="if-title">One core. Four ways in.</h2>
      <p class="lede">The same Rust core decides who owns a port and whether it's safe to touch. Each interface only renders and confirms what it says.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Interfaces" data-tabs>
      {tabs.map((t, i) => (
        <button type="button" role="tab" id={`if-tab-${t.key}`} aria-controls={`if-${t.key}`} aria-selected={i === 0 ? "true" : "false"} tabindex={i === 0 ? 0 : -1} data-key={t.key}>
          <Icon name={t.icon} size={20} /> {t.label}
        </button>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="panel" role="tabpanel" id="if-cli" aria-labelledby="if-tab-cli">
      <div class="text">
        <h3>A scriptable CLI</h3>
        <p>Look, act, wait and free ports from any shell or script. Plain-English answers for people, <code>--json</code> for tools, and exit codes that mean something.</p>
        <ul class="ticks">
          <li><code>portwise explain 3000</code> says who holds it and what to do</li>
          <li><code>portwise wait 5432 --timeout 30s</code> for CI and scripts</li>
          <li><code>portwise free-port --near 3000</code> picks the next free one</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="more" href={url("docs/cli/")}>CLI reference <Icon name="ArrowRight" size={16} /></a>
      </div>
      <figure class="visual window cli-window">
        <div class="window-bar"><span class="dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="window-title">~/code/shop-web</span></div>
        <pre class="term cli-term" aria-label="portwise explain, wait and free-port in a terminal"><code set:html={cliSession.map(toHtml).join("\n")} /></pre>
      </figure>
    </div>

    <div class="panel" role="tabpanel" id="if-tui" aria-labelledby="if-tab-tui" hidden>
      <div class="text">
        <h3>A TUI that stays out of the way</h3>
        <p>Run <code>portwise</code> with no arguments. Arrow through ports, filter as you type, read the details pane and stop with a confirm, all from the keyboard.</p>
        <ul class="ticks">
          <li>Same details as the desktop app: tree, memory, connections</li>
          <li>The service graph in the terminal</li>
          <li>Works over SSH sessions and in tmux</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <figure class="visual"><Picture src={tuiShot} formats={["avif"]} fallbackFormat="webp" widths={[640, 1374]} sizes={sizes} alt="The portwise TUI: a port table with the details pane for the selected port" loading="lazy" /></figure>
    </div>

    <div class="panel" role="tabpanel" id="if-desktop" aria-labelledby="if-tab-desktop" hidden>
      <div class="text">
        <h3>A desktop and tray app</h3>
        <p>The port list, details, the service graph, pins, history with one-click restart and remote hosts over SSH. <kbd>⌘</kbd><kbd>⌥</kbd><kbd>P</kbd> brings it up from any app.</p>
        <ul class="ticks">
          <li>Command palette on <kbd>⌘</kbd><kbd>K</kbd> / <kbd>Ctrl</kbd><kbd>K</kbd></li>
          <li>Open in browser, editor or Finder; copy the URL or a <code>curl</code></li>
          <li>Light and dark, fully keyboard driven</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="more" href={url("#demo")}>Try it live <Icon name="ArrowRight" size={16} /></a>
      </div>
      <figure class="visual">
        <Picture src={graphShot} formats={["avif"]} fallbackFormat="webp" widths={[640, 1280]} sizes={sizes} alt="The service graph: a Compose cluster with shop-web, shop-api, db and redis" loading="lazy" pictureAttributes={{ class: "only-dark" }} />
        <Picture src={paletteShot} formats={["avif"]} fallbackFormat="webp" widths={[640, 1280]} sizes={sizes} alt="The command palette searching for stop" loading="lazy" pictureAttributes={{ class: "only-light" }} />
      </figure>
    </div>

    <div class="panel" role="tabpanel" id="if-mcp" aria-labelledby="if-tab-mcp" hidden>
      <div class="text">
        <h3>An MCP server for AI agents</h3>
        <p><code>portwise mcp</code> gives coding assistants seven tools: list, explain, find a free port, wait, read the graph, plan a cluster stop (dry run only) and stop their own dev servers. Protected processes are always refused.</p>
        <div class="code">
          <div class="code-bar"><span>~/.cursor/mcp.json</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy={mcpJson} aria-label="Copy the MCP configuration"><Icon name="Copy" size={16} class="i-copy" /><Icon name="Check" size={16} class="i-done" /></button></div>
          <pre><code>{mcpJson}</code></pre>
        </div>
        <a class="more" href={url("docs/mcp/")}>Set up Claude, Cursor or VS Code <Icon name="ArrowRight" size={16} /></a>
      </div>
      <figure class="visual chat" aria-label="An AI agent using portwise tools">
        <div class="msg user">The dev server won't start, port 3000 is taken.</div>
        <div class="tool"><Icon name="Wrench" size={16} /> explain_port <span>{"{ port: 3000 }"}</span></div>
        <div class="msg agent">It's an old <b>Next.js</b> server from <b>shop-web</b> on <code>feat/checkout</code>, started 2 hours ago. It's yours and safe to stop.</div>
        <div class="tool"><Icon name="Wrench" size={16} /> stop_port <span>{"{ port: 3000 }"}</span></div>
        <div class="msg agent"><span class="ok">✔</span> Stopped 2 processes; port 3000 is free. Starting your server now.</div>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .tabs { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; margin: 0 auto 28px; padding: 4px; width: fit-content; max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; border-radius: var(--r-md); border: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--surface); }
  .tabs button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; height: 40px; padding: 0 16px; border: 0; border-radius: var(--r-sm); background: transparent; color: var(--muted); font-size: var(--fs-md); font-weight: 500; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; }
  .tabs button :global(svg) { flex: none; }
  .tabs button:hover { color: var(--text); }
  .tabs button[aria-selected="true"] { background: var(--surface-3); color: var(--text); }
  .panel { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.25fr); gap: clamp(28px, 4vw, 56px); align-items: center; padding: clamp(24px, 3vw, 40px); border-radius: var(--r-xl); border: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--surface); }
  .panel[hidden] { display: none; }
  h3 { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: var(--fs-h3); letter-spacing: -0.025em; line-height: 1.2; }
  .text > p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); }
  .text code { font-size: 0.875em; padding: 0.125em 0.375em; white-space: nowrap; border-radius: var(--r-xs); background: var(--surface-2); color: var(--text-2); }
  .ticks { list-style: none; margin: 20px 0 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 12px; color: var(--text-2); font-size: var(--fs-md); }
  .ticks li { position: relative; padding-left: 28px; }
  .ticks li::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 2px; top: 8px; width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: var(--r-xs); border: 1.5px solid var(--accent); background: var(--accent-soft); }
  .more { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 20px; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
  .more:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .visual { margin: 0; border-radius: var(--r-lg); overflow: hidden; box-shadow: var(--shadow); background: var(--term-bg); }
  .visual :global(img) { width: 100%; }
  kbd { margin: 0 1px; }
  .code { margin-top: 20px; border-radius: var(--r-md); overflow: hidden; background: var(--term-bg); border: 1px solid var(--term-line); }
  .code-bar { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 8px 8px 8px 16px; font: 12px var(--mono); color: #8a91a3; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--term-line); }
  .code pre { margin: 0; padding: 16px; font-size: var(--fs-sm); line-height: var(--lh-code); color: #d7dae3; overflow-x: auto; }
  .code pre code { background: none; padding: 0; color: inherit; font-size: inherit; }
  .copy { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: var(--r-sm); border: 1px solid var(--term-line-strong); background: transparent; color: #d7dae3; cursor: pointer; }
  .copy :global(.i-done) { display: none; color: #4ade80; }
  .copy[data-copied] :global(.i-done) { display: block; }
  .copy[data-copied] :global(.i-copy) { display: none; }
  .chat { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; padding: 24px; background: var(--bg-2); border: 1px solid var(--border); box-shadow: none; font-size: var(--fs-md); }
  .msg { max-width: 88%; padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: var(--r-lg); line-height: 1.5; }
  .user { align-self: flex-end; background: var(--accent); color: var(--accent-fg); border-bottom-right-radius: 4px; }
  .agent { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-bottom-left-radius: 4px; color: var(--text-2); }
  .agent code { font-size: 0.875em; color: var(--accent); }
  .ok { color: var(--green); }
  .tool { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; width: fit-content; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: var(--r-sm); font: 500 var(--fs-sm) var(--mono); color: var(--muted); border: 1px dashed var(--border-strong); }
  .tool span { color: var(--text-2); }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .panel { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .tabs { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); width: 100%; }
    .tabs button { justify-content: center; padding: 0 4px; gap: 4px; font-size: var(--fs-ui); }
  }
  .cli-window { background: var(--term-bg); }
  .cli-window .window-bar { background: #12131a; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--term-line); color: #8a91a3; }
  .cli-term { margin: 0; padding: 20px; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
</style>
